{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POLITICAL ARENA is a one-of-a-kind strategy/sim sandbox about American politics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek fame or infamy in a richly simulated political world, complete with high stakes legislative strategizing, backroom deals and the press. Customize and play as the politician of your dreams (or nightmares).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your politician\u2019s appearance, personality, views, ideology, influence, skills and agenda.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the partisan breakdown of congress, the president\u2019s party and ideology, what the filibuster threshold is and just how partisan and ideological the world is. See how these settings impact outcomes and your style of play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE AN IMPACT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your agenda a reality by drafting bills impacting dozens of policies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lobby the White House to see your agenda placed front and center, even being featured in the Inauguration and State of the Union.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work behind the scenes to secure votes for your legislation and lobby for your bills, even during a vote.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DYNAMIC WORLD</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each NPC\u2019s agenda and personality shapes their behavior: how likely they are to break promises, remember their friends, punish their enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs evolve over time, cultivating alliances, grudges and reputations.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670920/extras/ac200dd2286af5393859e36d012ca4b7.avif?t=1756815349\" width=400 height=1208 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Yea, You Did It!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1670920/1f6d47f6a092acae054535f60ef80004fad3ca39.jpg"},{"name":"Watch Me Nay Nay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1670920/e5b9b3193bb9932d7f4422586ab8f4b5c9ba9e3e.jpg"},{"name":"In the Arena","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1670920/5a9d43c51f76f512764135c4f017591afa38fa73.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Hate The Game, Hate The Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1670920/ba6008d72bfc59d9558ee3729f051cef07e1bd7a.jpg"},{"name":"How Do You Do, Fellow Kids?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1670920/3d14d67a6436d21531b71230fb704f2640afbbf5.jpg"},{"name":"Congratulations, It's A Bill!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1670920/244a2b7b32e35babb7b054e0b80182074e3ada76.jpg"},{"name":"It Can't Be Vetoed If It Doesn't Pass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1670920/9d7eeb629f2cf92cbc85d23bf118148ad438b3f0.jpg"},{"name":"Aisle Crosser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1670920/412e156875f0a19780070b8e90a30e45b6bd68a2.jpg"},{"name":"Bill, Baby, Bill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1670920/c1b1f2ea0d108901553eb9a457a6eacdb3f6044b.jpg"},{"name":"Chamber Made","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1670920/153bbf1e085f30d440d90dbda63cfce811f25cac.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1670920?t=1756815349","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1670920?t=1756815349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670920/8e0a0e21613aa53fa446ea6f3bae27b219eaa54a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756815349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670920/8e0a0e21613aa53fa446ea6f3bae27b219eaa54a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756815349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Political Arena is set in U.S. politics, and as such sometimes alludes to \u2013 but does not depict \u2013 mature and sensitive themes. \r\n\r\nGenerally speaking, those players mature enough to follow the news will likely find Political Arena\u2019s content to be commensurate with the mature themes of global and political events.  \r\n\r\nLike real life politics, the game will sometimes allude to public figures behaving in immature ways or caught up in adult situations. and also feature legislation that aims to address topics that may be triggering to some players. \r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POLITICAL ARENA is a one-of-a-kind strategy/sim sandbox about American politics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek fame or infamy in a richly simulated political world, complete with high stakes legislative strategizing, backroom deals and the press. Customize and play as the politician of your dreams (or nightmares).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your politician\u2019s appearance, personality, views, ideology, influence, skills and agenda.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the partisan breakdown of congress, the president\u2019s party and ideology, what the filibuster threshold is and just how partisan and ideological the world is. See how these settings impact outcomes and your style of play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE AN IMPACT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your agenda a reality by drafting bills impacting dozens of policies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lobby the White House to see your agenda placed front and center, even being featured in the Inauguration and State of the Union.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work behind the scenes to secure votes for your legislation and lobby for your bills, even during a vote.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DYNAMIC WORLD</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each NPC\u2019s agenda and personality shapes their behavior: how likely they are to break promises, remember their friends, punish their enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs evolve over time, cultivating alliances, grudges and reputations.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670920/extras/ac200dd2286af5393859e36d012ca4b7.avif?t=1756815349\" width=400 height=1208 /></span></p>","developers":["Wayside Press"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670920/40b03ac0fa5cb9ff114df6bb0b7c2c7cbfb1c717/header.jpg?t=1756815349","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2024 Wayside Press, Inc.","linux_requiremen